    "raw": "Phase changes: 317.3 K, melting point of P; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.157$ kcal/mol.\n368.3 K, orthorhombic - monoclinic transition point of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.096$ kcal/mol.\n388.36 K, melting point of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.413$ kcal/mol.\n432.02 K, second order transformation of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0$ kcal/mol.\n550 K, boiling point of P; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.908$ kcal/mol of P.\n717.824 K, boiling point of S to equilibrium mixture of $S_{n}$ (n = 1 to 8). \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n<table><tr><td>298.15-3000 K:</td><td> $Cp^o = 8.843 + 0.108x10^{-3}T - 0.403x10^5T^{-2}$ </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"> $H^o - H_{298}^o = 8.843x10^{-3}T + 0.054x10^{-6}T^2 + 0.403x10^2T^{-1} - 2.777$ </td></tr></table>\nFormation equations (kcal/mol): \n<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">298.15-317.3 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = 37.846 - 3.130x10^{-3}T - 1.414x10^{-6}T^{2} - 115.300T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = 37.846 + 3.130x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 1.414x10^{-6}T^{2} - 57.650T^{-1} - 60.947x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">317.3-368.3 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = 38.159 - 5.623x10^{-3}T + 1.771x10^{-6}T^{2} - 115.300T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = 38.159 + 5.623x10^{-3}T\\ln T - 1.771x10^{-6}T^{2} - 57.650T^{-1} - 75.283x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">368.3-388.36 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = 37.044 - 3.360x10^{-3}T + 0.025x10^{-6}T^{2} + 40.300T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = 37.044 + 3.360x10^{-3}T\\ln T - 0.025x10^{-6}T^{2} + 20.150T^{-1} - 60.101x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">388.36-432.02 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = 20.886 + 41.380x10^{-3}T - 43.257x10^{-6}T^{2} + 1942.500T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = 20.886 - 41.380x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 43.257x10^{-6}T^{2} + 971.250T^{-1} + 225.128x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">432.02-550 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = 11.407 + 37.474x10^{-3}T -